    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'integral_wrt_time_of_radioactivity_concentration_of_118mIn_in_air'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The phrase "integral_wrt_X_of_Y" means int Y dX. The data variable should have an axis for X specifying the limits of the integral as bounds. The phrase "wrt" means "with respect to". "Radioactivity" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. "Radioactivity concentration" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. "In" means the element "indium" and "118mIn" is the metastable state of the isotope "indium-118" with a half-life of 3.05e-03 days.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P07::025PDJLV'^^xsd:string .
